sequenceDiagram
    %% SD7 - Handle no-shows
    %% Stories: 42, 43, 44, 45, 46
    %% Description: An admin sees missed bookings and how often a customer did not show up. The customer is notified, and repeated no-shows are fined.
    actor AD as Admin
    participant BK as Booking
    participant CU as Customer

    %% covers 43
    AD->>BK: see missed bookings
    %% covers 42
    BK->>CU: notify of missed session
    %% covers 44
    AD->>CU: see number of no-shows
    %% covers 45, 46
    AD->>CU: fine repeated no-shows
